                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c46a658d-e266-4fb1-bc64-01826acf3a55",
                                                "sense_id": "2785cf5b-bd93-3ea2-96e5-6d8f1b2a2b6c",
                                                "text": "The judge pronounced banishment upon the war criminal."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0f4bf072-0038-352c-89f4-b2147ed0c992",
                                        "entry_id": "85d634bb-9774-3235-9ecf-d681ee726bd9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being banished, exile."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "998ec4dc-4e81-4525-b3f6-b2106bb33b8f",
                                                "sense_id": "0f4bf072-0038-352c-89f4-b2147ed0c992",
                                                "text": "He has been in banishment from his home country for well over four years."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c01c7ea4-e3e5-45ed-8537-005c128a5775",
                                                "sense_id": "0f4bf072-0038-352c-89f4-b2147ed0c992",
                                                "text": "You are in error. / This is terror. / This is your banishment. This land is mine. / This is what you earn. / This is the Law of No Return. / This is the sour dough, this the sweet wine. / This is my history, this my race / And this unhappy man threw acid in my face."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0db3c2b7-bcb9-42c3-b89a-11bdde4054fa",
                        "source_entry_id": "c39cdddf-5ee7-37aa-aef1-569f20ffc715",
                        "source_sense_id": "ae93e653-2a7b-3c0b-80b4-59a0df6d03cc",
                        "source_sense_description": "der Ausschluss aus einer Gemeinschaft/Gruppe",
                        "target_lang_word": "exclusion",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "exclusion",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "51d16557-521c-30c3-8dba-1e88280f11b9",
                                        "entry_id": "1a2963c8-c775-3858-9f58-c130e7ba59b4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of excluding or shutting out; removal from consideration or taking part."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9bf8d809-8072-4662-83a1-7f641e2bd6d9",
                                                "sense_id": "51d16557-521c-30c3-8dba-1e88280f11b9",
                                                "text": "Mr. JOHNSON: But this amendment does not go far enough. I suppose the framers of the amendment thought it was necessary to provide for such an exigency. I do not see but that any one of these gentlemen may be elected President or Vice President of the United States, and why did you omit to exclude them? I do not understand them to be excluded from the privilege of holding the two highest offices in the gift of the nation. No man is to be a Senator or Representative or an elector for President or Vice President——\nMr. MORRILL: Let me call the Senator's attention to the words \"or hold any office, civil or military, under the United States.\"\nMr. JOHNSON: Perhaps I am wrong as to the exclusion from the Presidency: no doubt I am; but I was misled by noticing the specific exclusion in the case of Senators and Representatives. But I submit to the Senate whether it is advisable, whether it is politic, looking to the end which we all seek to accomplish, the true restoration of the Union, a union of hearts as well as a union of hands, that you should exclude the large mass of people from participating in the honors of the Government who will be excluded by this provision."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61123642-8018-4e7d-b721-49bd9220a7ac",
                                                "sense_id": "51d16557-521c-30c3-8dba-1e88280f11b9",
                                                "text": "Two Dutch journalists entering the country were detained at JFK International Airport March 30 because they openly declared that they were homosexuals. They were subsequently released on parole pending an exclusion hearing in Manhattan April 2."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77c488ac-4689-4cb9-ae0b-0a6fb2485aec",
                                                "sense_id": "51d16557-521c-30c3-8dba-1e88280f11b9",
                                                "text": "It was also a satisfying night for England coach Capello. Not only did he have a vital victory to celebrate, but his team selection was fully justified as Cahill gave an almost flawless performance in defence and Scott Parker's display made light of the surprising exclusion of Frank Lampard."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7e3ce500-835d-3741-afb4-5b92f00275eb",
                                        "entry_id": "1a2963c8-c775-3858-9f58-c130e7ba59b4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of pushing or forcing something out."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "067022b4-520d-4857-9370-6f19c39ce1cb",
                                                "sense_id": "7e3ce500-835d-3741-afb4-5b92f00275eb",
                                                "text": "For the exclusion of animals is not merely passive like that of eggs, nor the total action of delivery to be imputed unto the mother, but the first attempt beginneth from the infant [...]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "94a434d7-2896-38ab-9bab-ee981950d523",
                                        "entry_id": "1a2963c8-c775-3858-9f58-c130e7ba59b4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An item not covered by an insurance policy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ab095947-d798-4f02-ba68-e93a45b43a8e",
                        "source_entry_id": "c39cdddf-5ee7-37aa-aef1-569f20ffc715",
                        "source_sense_id": "ae93e653-2a7b-3c0b-80b4-59a0df6d03cc",
                        "source_sense_description": "der Ausschluss aus einer Gemeinschaft/Gruppe",
                        "target_lang_word": "ostracism",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ostracism",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aba06d89-526f-356d-a468-60208b09d744",
                                        "entry_id": "d5d0f48e-ee80-3ba5-b437-915fcff3a7ed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In ancient Athens (and some other cities), the temporary banishment by popular vote of a citizen considered dangerous to the state."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "historical",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7606a8c4-5979-447c-9999-4f329dae263d",
                                                "sense_id": "aba06d89-526f-356d-a468-60208b09d744",
                                                "text": "For this manner of banishment for a time, called ostracismos, was no punishment for any fault committed, but a mitigation and taking away of the envy of the people, which delighted to pluck down their stomacks that too much seemed to exceed in greatness: […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f6f1198-e61b-4dda-a7f6-b1d70f2a6ebf",
                                                "sense_id": "aba06d89-526f-356d-a468-60208b09d744",
                                                "text": "Take the ſweete herbe called pleaſant content; with that make a perfume about your bed chamber and where you dyne: the ſavour of this is as ſure a repulſe to exile melancholie, as the oſtracisme was to the noble of Athens."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac555844-51ce-4d22-9e6e-0c2c6b30c0d6",
                                                "sense_id": "aba06d89-526f-356d-a468-60208b09d744",
                                                "text": "Witnesse the Ostracisme amongst the Athenians, and the Petalisme among the Siracusans."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7629623b-d171-35b2-86fd-cd440b557f15",
                                        "entry_id": "d5d0f48e-ee80-3ba5-b437-915fcff3a7ed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Banishment by some general consent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ea1f59d-7e12-492b-837a-908c32f10896",
                                                "sense_id": "7629623b-d171-35b2-86fd-cd440b557f15",
                                                "text": "If I have deserved the land should spue me out, I will feed my selfe with the idle and windy conceite of an Ostracisme, and my unregarded poore selfe shall be all the richesse and commpany I crave to transport and if a Princes word […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2c5c1dae-b552-33a4-ab88-828436942eb1",
                                        "entry_id": "d5d0f48e-ee80-3ba5-b437-915fcff3a7ed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Temporary exclusion from a community or society."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
